  "title": {
   "en": "Danggol"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "당골"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "At Yeongweoldang shrine lives Kim Seo-ryeong, a veteran mansin (female shaman).\nNoh Seung-rae, who was born into a shaman family yet has spent his life rejecting the calling, seeks her help because his young daughter has suddenly lost her sight.\nOffended by Seung-rae’s scornful disbelief in shamanism, Seo-ryeong turns him down and leaves.\nBut that very night—and every night after—unsettling dreams invade Seo-ryeong’s sleep, showing her fragments of Seung-rae’s past.\nUnable to ignore the signs, she starts investigating the household… and the aura surrounding that little girl is anything but ordinary!"
  },
